        <mxCell id="p2note" value="Each app is its own process and reads the lake on its own. The React console has a header, a highlighted scenario, five panels, one primary button, and a result sentence. Colors are neutral. Official Birlasoft assets are not on the page. Compose was rebuilt on 2026-10-19. MODEL_MODE=replay plays a saved answer. A missing file abstains. The packaged sqlite stays read-only." style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=13;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1">
